<title>USA: Gottschalks December same-store sales down.</title>
<headline>Gottschalks December same-store sales down.</headline>
<text>
<p>FRESNO, Calif., Jan 9 (Reuter)</p>
<p>							 Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$83.2	$83.1	+0.2	 -2.6</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $400.8     $376.8	+6.4	 +2.3</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>Sales are for the five weeks ended January 4, 1997 compared with the five weeks ended December 30, 1995.</p>
<p>    Full company name is			   Gottschalks Inc</p>
</text>
